@startuml
!theme plain
title v1.4 Scoped User Invitation
actor "Institution Administrator" as Admin
actor Invitee
participant "Unified Web Shell" as Web
participant "FastAPI" as API
database PostgreSQL as DB
participant "Notification Service\n(future)" as Notify

Admin -> Web: Invite user and choose independent roles/scopes
Web -> API: POST /users/invitations
API -> DB: Verify users.manage on active role assignment
API -> DB: Store invitation token hash and role grants
API -> DB: Write audit and outbox events
API -> Notify: Queue time-limited link (production)
API --> Web: Invitation metadata only

Invitee -> Web: Open invitation link
Web -> API: POST /auth/invitations/accept
API -> API: Parse tenant; hash token
API -> DB: SET LOCAL app.tenant_id
API -> DB: Validate pending unexpired invitation
API -> DB: Create/reuse user; create active membership
API -> DB: Create Argon2 credential only when absent
API -> DB: Materialise access scopes and role assignments
API -> DB: Mark accepted and audit
API --> Web: Acceptance confirmation
@enduml
